---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) Template | usignpdf"
  seo={{
    page_description: "Free, customizable Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) template ready for electronic signature.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/templates/nda/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/templates" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Templates</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) Template</h1>

    <p>A Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) is one of the most commonly signed documents in business. It protects your sensitive information when discussing potential partnerships, <a href="/use-cases/agencies">agency work</a>, or hiring.</p>

    <div class="bg-surface-alt p-6 border border-border rounded my-8 flex justify-between items-center not-prose">
        <span class="font-bold">Standard Mutual NDA (PDF)</span>
        <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-surface rounded hover:bg-accent-hover font-semibold">Download PDF</a>
    </div>

    <h2>Getting it signed</h2>
    <p>NDAs are meant to be fast. Don't slow down a deal by forcing a client to print, sign, and scan (which <a href="/tools/paper-cost-calculator">costs money and time</a>). Use usignpdf to send the NDA instantly and track when they <a href="/blog/how-to-track-document-opens">open the document</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
